mWizard
=======

mWizard is a fork of EMWM (https://github.com/alx210/emwm), which is itself
derived from the Motif Window Manager (mwm), originally published by
The Open Group.

mWizard is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by alx@fastestcode.org
or The Open Group. "Motif" is a trademark of The Open Group; mWizard links
against Motif but is not a Motif product and does not claim to be one.


